Shows Claude Code and Codex plan usage (5-hour and weekly windows) for one or
more accounts. Click the bar button to open it; it fetches fresh usage every
time it opens. Click outside it or press Escape to close it. Running the
command again while it is open also closes it.

Accounts are listed in ~/.config/claude-tracker/config.toml.
"""

